        <title>Perch</title>
        <item>
            <title>0.2.3</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:13:24 -0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Clicking Perch's icon while the panel is open now closes it cleanly instead of flashing it shut and open again.</li>
<li>Perch's icon turns from pointing left to pointing down as the panel opens, and back as it closes.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
