        <item>
            <title>0.2.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:06:31 -0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Fixes Wi-Fi and other macOS icons in Hidden flipping back into view on macOS 27.</li>
<li>Icons you move to Hidden now sit next to Perch's icon, so showing them only adds icons at the chevron. Use "Move Hidden Icons Next to Perch" in the settings menu to gather the ones you already have.</li>
<li>Smoother show and hide, and old duplicate rows from Perch 0.1.0 are cleaned up.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/alecramos-sudo/perch-releases/releases/download/v0.2.2-4/Perch-0.2.2-4.zip" length="2623051" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="tHhYytEt3sa4Y0hGDKjiOHul84VBZZqSRD6Ib25KLRziDLtksMJvnoBar8ZyMKYYeHqfP/bn14vwdCFZvDUrCg=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.2.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:39:38 -0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Fixes Perch staying untrusted after an upgrade from an older build: "Grant Accessibility access…" now clears Perch's outdated permission entry and asks macOS to add it again.</li>
<li>Perch notices the permission as soon as you turn it on, without a restart.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
